    <string name="fixedip_guide_step3">3. On the router, open its DHCP reservation page (also called static lease or address binding) and add these two values. Android does not let the app read the MAC: copy it from Wi-Fi settings, Advanced, Wi-Fi MAC address, and type it here.</string>
